      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T12:22:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, in PS14 they could, since the four interfaces were created together. Now each `Decorator` interface is created only when a property that belongs to it is set, so empty values and field types with no `Decorator` property (`Vendor`, `Chassis`, ...) never create one. `Decorator.Asset` has several properties, so those without a field are still empty.",
      "parentUuid": "2ac083ba_54f78e80",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 97,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 100,
        "endChar": 25
      },
